    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal would meet the definition of a caravan as defined by both the Caravan Sites and Control of Development Act 1960 and the Caravan Sites Act 1968.&amp;nbsp; It would also be used for purposes incidental to the enjoyment of the existing dwellinghouse at 106 Shrewsbury Avenue, Kenton, Harrow, HA3 9NF. The proposal would therefore not require planning permission as it would not constitute development under the terms of Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.&lt;/p&gt;"
